2. Compute the time complexity for the following code:
sum = 0;
for (i = 0; i < n; i++)
  for (j = 0; j < n; j++)
    sum ++;
(A) O(n)
(B) O(n log n)
(C) O(log n)
(D) O(n^2) [1]

